---
import './network.css';
---

<figure id="dd-network-costs" class="not-prose" aria-labelledby="ddnw-title" aria-describedby="ddnw-note">
  <header class="ddnw-heading">
    <h2 id="ddnw-title">Which site can <br>you spare?</h2>
    <p>Each closure leaves room for the stock. Follow the deliveries.</p>
  </header>
  <fieldset class="ddnw-controls">
    <legend class="ddnw-sr">Choose a site to close in this illustrative network</legend>
    <div class="ddnw-choices"><label><input id="ddnw-all" type="radio" name="ddnw-closure" value="all" ><span>All open</span></label><label><input id="ddnw-west" type="radio" name="ddnw-closure" value="west" ><span>Close West</span></label><label><input id="ddnw-central" type="radio" name="ddnw-closure" value="central" checked><span>Close Central</span></label><label><input id="ddnw-east" type="radio" name="ddnw-closure" value="east" ><span>Close East</span></label></div>
  </fieldset>
  <div class="ddnw-panels" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
  <section class="ddnw-state ddnw-all" aria-label="All sites open">
    <div class="ddnw-diagram" role="group" aria-label="All sites open. West customers: 42 deliveries weekly, served from West, 25 kilometres one way. Central customers: 6 deliveries weekly, served from Central, 5 kilometres one way. East customers: 12 deliveries weekly, served from East, 25 kilometres one way.">
      <div class="ddnw-diagram-label">Storage used / capacity <span>(pallets)</span></div>
      <div class="ddnw-sites"><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>West</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">240 / 300</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:80.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>Central</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">180 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:40.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>East</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">180 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:40.0000%"></i></span></div></div>
      <div class="ddnw-routes" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 158" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="158"><path class="ddnw-route" d="M100 0 C100 58 100 92 100 150" stroke-width="14.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="100" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M300 0 C300 58 300 92 300 150" stroke-width="2.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="300" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M500 0 C500 58 500 92 500 150" stroke-width="4.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="500" cy="150" r="4"/></svg>
        <span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:16.6667%;top:89px">25 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:50.0000%;top:89px">5 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:83.3333%;top:89px">25 km</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ddnw-customers"><div><strong>42<span> / week</span></strong><span>West customers</span></div><div><strong>6<span> / week</span></strong><span>Central customers</span></div><div><strong>12<span> / week</span></strong><span>East customers</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ddnw-results">
      <div><strong>0<span> km</span></strong><span>Extra driving / week</span></div>
      <div class=""><strong>0<span> of 60</span></strong><span>Beyond assumed 100 km reach</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ddnw-takeaway">Try closing Central: it handles the fewest deliveries.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ddnw-state ddnw-west" aria-label="Close West">
    <div class="ddnw-diagram" role="group" aria-label="Close West. West customers: 42 deliveries weekly, served from Central, 95 kilometres one way. Central customers: 6 deliveries weekly, served from Central, 5 kilometres one way. East customers: 12 deliveries weekly, served from East, 25 kilometres one way.">
      <div class="ddnw-diagram-label">Storage used / capacity <span>(pallets)</span></div>
      <div class="ddnw-sites"><div class="ddnw-site ddnw-closed"><h3>West</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">Closed</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:0.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>Central</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">420 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:93.3333%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>East</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">180 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:40.0000%"></i></span></div></div>
      <div class="ddnw-routes" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 158" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="158"><path class="ddnw-route ddnw-rerouted" d="M300 0 C300 58 100 92 100 150" stroke-width="14.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop ddnw-rerouted" cx="100" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M300 0 C300 58 300 92 300 150" stroke-width="2.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="300" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M500 0 C500 58 500 92 500 150" stroke-width="4.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="500" cy="150" r="4"/></svg>
        <span class="ddnw-distance ddnw-rerouted" style="left:33.3333%;top:51px">95 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:50.0000%;top:89px">5 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:83.3333%;top:89px">25 km</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ddnw-customers"><div><strong>42<span> / week</span></strong><span>West customers</span></div><div><strong>6<span> / week</span></strong><span>Central customers</span></div><div><strong>12<span> / week</span></strong><span>East customers</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ddnw-results">
      <div><strong>+5,880<span> km</span></strong><span>Extra driving / week</span></div>
      <div class=""><strong>0<span> of 60</span></strong><span>Beyond assumed 100 km reach</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ddnw-takeaway">Frequent western deliveries multiply the detour, even though the stock fits.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ddnw-state ddnw-central" aria-label="Close Central">
    <div class="ddnw-diagram" role="group" aria-label="Close Central. West customers: 42 deliveries weekly, served from West, 25 kilometres one way. Central customers: 6 deliveries weekly, served from East, 115 kilometres one way. East customers: 12 deliveries weekly, served from East, 25 kilometres one way.">
      <div class="ddnw-diagram-label">Storage used / capacity <span>(pallets)</span></div>
      <div class="ddnw-sites"><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>West</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">240 / 300</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:80.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site ddnw-closed"><h3>Central</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">Closed</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:0.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>East</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">360 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:80.0000%"></i></span></div></div>
      <div class="ddnw-routes" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 158" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="158"><path class="ddnw-route" d="M100 0 C100 58 100 92 100 150" stroke-width="14.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="100" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route ddnw-rerouted ddnw-outside" d="M500 0 C500 58 300 92 300 150" stroke-width="2.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop ddnw-rerouted ddnw-outside" cx="300" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M500 0 C500 58 500 92 500 150" stroke-width="4.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="500" cy="150" r="4"/></svg>
        <span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:16.6667%;top:89px">25 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance ddnw-rerouted ddnw-outside" style="left:66.6667%;top:51px">115 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:83.3333%;top:89px">25 km</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ddnw-customers"><div><strong>42<span> / week</span></strong><span>West customers</span></div><div><strong>6<span> / week</span></strong><span>Central customers</span></div><div><strong>12<span> / week</span></strong><span>East customers</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ddnw-results">
      <div><strong>+1,320<span> km</span></strong><span>Extra driving / week</span></div>
      <div class="ddnw-reach-warning"><strong>6<span> of 60</span></strong><span>Beyond assumed 100 km reach</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ddnw-takeaway">The quietest site keeps six weekly deliveries within the assumed reach.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ddnw-state ddnw-east" aria-label="Close East">
    <div class="ddnw-diagram" role="group" aria-label="Close East. West customers: 42 deliveries weekly, served from West, 25 kilometres one way. Central customers: 6 deliveries weekly, served from Central, 5 kilometres one way. East customers: 12 deliveries weekly, served from Central, 95 kilometres one way.">
      <div class="ddnw-diagram-label">Storage used / capacity <span>(pallets)</span></div>
      <div class="ddnw-sites"><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>West</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">240 / 300</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:80.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site "><h3>Central</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">360 / 450</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:80.0000%"></i></span></div><div class="ddnw-site ddnw-closed"><h3>East</h3><span class="ddnw-storage">Closed</span><span class="ddnw-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:0.0000%"></i></span></div></div>
      <div class="ddnw-routes" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 158" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="158"><path class="ddnw-route" d="M100 0 C100 58 100 92 100 150" stroke-width="14.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="100" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route" d="M300 0 C300 58 300 92 300 150" stroke-width="2.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop" cx="300" cy="150" r="4"/><path class="ddnw-route ddnw-rerouted" d="M300 0 C300 58 500 92 500 150" stroke-width="4.0"/><circle class="ddnw-stop ddnw-rerouted" cx="500" cy="150" r="4"/></svg>
        <span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:16.6667%;top:89px">25 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance" style="left:50.0000%;top:89px">5 km</span><span class="ddnw-distance ddnw-rerouted" style="left:66.6667%;top:51px">95 km</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ddnw-customers"><div><strong>42<span> / week</span></strong><span>West customers</span></div><div><strong>6<span> / week</span></strong><span>Central customers</span></div><div><strong>12<span> / week</span></strong><span>East customers</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ddnw-results">
      <div><strong>+1,680<span> km</span></strong><span>Extra driving / week</span></div>
      <div class=""><strong>0<span> of 60</span></strong><span>Beyond assumed 100 km reach</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ddnw-takeaway">All deliveries stay within the assumed reach. Costs still need comparing.</p>
  </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="ddnw-note">
    <span>Illustrative network. Route distances are one way; drawing not to scale.</span>
    <details><summary>How this example works</summary><p>Each delivery is a separate return trip. Line width shows deliveries per week. When a site closes, its stock and deliveries move to the nearest remaining site. The assumed delivery reach is 100 km one way; exceeding it does not predict late deliveries. Storage figures are pallets, not handling capacity. This example compares journeys and storage, not total cost or the best site to close.</p></details>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
